abstract: >
  OncoGuard-AI is a research/educational prototype for adaptive oncology
  early warning and clinical decision support: a .NET backend, a Python
  FastAPI risk-prediction service (10 XGBoost models), an Android patient
  app and a clinician web dashboard. The bundled dataset is fully synthetic.
  Not a medical device.
